WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.190
Hyah!

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.870
This sharp-edged brilliance...

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.580
It's nothing short of diabolical.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:35.640
Discipline and improve yourself,

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:44.020
or else you'll inevitably be consumed 
and overpowered by the sword.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:57.300
You therefore mustn't rely on anyone,
 nor get close to anyone.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:02.580
All on your own, you must polish 
the true self buried within you.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.210
It is a path of solitude.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:18.510
Now, which path will you choose,
 my dear Wendy?

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.480
Shoot!

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.040
I'm heading out, Dad.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:36.650
Aw...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.580
W-Wait!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.000
The faster the car, the better!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.550
If you want to go fast and feel great,
 I highly recommend this ORION.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:03.070
You're right. 
The best part of a car is driving it.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.070
You get it.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.810
Indeed, this one's fantastic.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.180
I think I'll take it.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.980
A-Are you sure, sir?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.560
If you'd like a test drive,
 we can do that right now.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.490
Shall we?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.890
The newbie stole my client...

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:18.800
Unfortunately, I have a meeting soon.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:18.800
Finn is actually smooth and resourceful,

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.330
Maybe tomorrow.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.210
so maybe he's a better salesman—

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:21.210
There's no way!

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.000
Oh, here's my card.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.730
Wendy, when did you get here?

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.870
It's nice to meet you.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:26.820
Yes, sir!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.480
Oh, my name is Finn Oldman.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.460
Um, Wendy? Hello, Wendy!

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.830
Finn? That's a nice name.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.550
I'll have the car ready 
for a test drive tomorrow.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.330
Thanks. See you tomorrow.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:41.210
Let's see here... 
Apple Link, CEO of Mizerka.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:45.700
Oh, that's an up-and-coming IT firm.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.100
An auspicious start, Finn.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:51.330
I bet it's all thanks to my guidance.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:55.230
You only taught me 
how to mop and pick up girls.

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:58.220
You just picked up a male client.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:01.340
Then I guess your advice was worthless, huh?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.860
You've got a mouth on you, you know that?!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:13.890
So you see, with my smooth 
sales talk, even an CEO—

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.580
Do you even know what a CEO is?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.900
Huh? Uh...

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.890
Chief executive officer.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.380
Yeah, that!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.510
I was going to say that.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.510
Here you go.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.420
For me?

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.020
This is your welcome party, isn't it?

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.390
It's on me.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.950
Good luck, rookie.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.770
Yup, this little rookie here
 will do his best...

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.810
Wendy, I see you're going as hard as ever.

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:43.230
Maybe you should...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.950
I see Chris is late, per usual.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.460
I swear. I need him to follow the rules.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.660
Rules?

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.220
Punctuality is one of the rules at Pinochle.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.420
And the rules are meant to be followed.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.490
I'm sure there's no need to 
be so uptight about it.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:06.400
Speaking of uptight, Wendy 
sure is a real workaholic.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.860
She's always fixated on her computer.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.340
Hi there!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.570
About time.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:16.460
Master, can I get café au lait float
 with extra ice cream?

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:20.230
Chris, you do know that this
 is a pub, don't you?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.290
So, what are we talking about?

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.750
We're educating Finn about 
what's taboo at Pinochle.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:26.870
Oh, that.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.890
Tardiness... Well, we can let that one go.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.250
Oh, but listen here.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.280
Taboo number one:

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.300
"Never let Wendy draw her sword."

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.160
Her sword?

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.920
Uh-huh. Because—

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.580
I won't!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.580
I will never draw my sword!

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.170
Master, another one!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.160
Hey now, I think you've had enough—

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.690
I! Want! Another! Round!

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:57.220
I just remembered something 
I need to do. I must be going.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.000
And I have to water my plants.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.040
Excuse me.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.940
What's wrong with those two?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:09.450
I'm just some uptight broad anyway, right?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:14.950
I'm too serious... I'm a workaholic...
and I got no friends!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.220
Taboo number two:

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:20.360
"Don't let Wendy have more
 than three drinks."

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.380
You coulda told me sooner!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.940
Are you listening to me?!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.410
Ouch!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.410
H-Hey, stop it!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.030
The path of solitude is lonely!

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.640
I want to do it right, but I can't!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:33.390
My dad could, so why can't I?!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.970
Why?!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.850
You must not touch this.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.850
Without the resolve to walk the path of 
solitude alone, you will be consumed!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.870
Shoot! Ow...

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:51.910
I had too much to drink again.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.550
<i>I'm nothing like my dad.</i>

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.740
<i>I gotta get it together.</i>

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.860
Yes. Yes, sir.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.130
Good.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.620
Oh? Where are the other two today?

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:47.190
Finn went on a test drive with 
the customer from yesterday.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.740
Chris got a call from the president.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.620
Understood.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.300
I will handle it as arranged.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.090
So I'm holding down the fort?

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:00.190
I'll be Chris's backup today.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.520
The case seems unlikely to require 
the drawing of your sword.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:06.300
But I'm a member of High Card too...

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:07.190
Come again?

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:08.500
It's nothing.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.340
Hello, Pinochle Automobiles' 
Old Maid Street branch—

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.930
Listen up, you all.

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:18.620
Don't move.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:21.560
Open the safe!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.740
Hurry up!

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.990
Be done with it in three minutes!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.610
Excuse me...

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.380
I'd like to use the bathroom...

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.190
<i>but my hands are tied.</i>

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.160
<i>Could you help me?</i>

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.130
<i>Don't mess with us!</i>

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.030
Oh, I wouldn't...

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.760
dream of it!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.760
Bastard!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.140
Now's our chance.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:47.950
Yeah.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.400
Idiots!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.630
Damn it.

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:58.090
Hey, you!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:58.490
C'mere!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:03.170
H-Help me!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.650
Ow, ow, ow...

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.890
The bastard emptied the magazine on me...

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.170
You heard all that, right?

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.220
<i>It's a group of four.</i>

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.210
<i>They've got a hostage.
 En route to Lorain Street.</i>

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.220
Roger. I'm on my way there now.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.300
Hold on.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.150
I'm coming too.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.990
We don't know what we're dealing with,

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.900
and we need to save the hostage.

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.620
The more assets, the better.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.060
But the order is for you to stand by.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:32.560
I know the company is trying to keep 
me and Love-P off of normal missions.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:33.570
But...

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:37.560
I will choose my own path.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:40.070
I won't rely on anyone.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.240
Even so...

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.330
Plus, I'm doing fine today.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:48.680
I wasn't late, was I?

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.000
Wow, what a fantastic car.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.950
It's perfect for me.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.880
And I can throw in some options for free.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.880
Are you sure, Finn?

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.240
Let's go, sir!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.140
Whoa!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.960
Tch... What the heck, man?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.040
I wonder if something happened...

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.790
Oh no! Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:19.240
I'm sorry, Mr. Apple... 
My stomach is killing me.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.400
Mind if I go find a bathroom?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.280
No, not at all.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.030
Go right ahead.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.410
I'm really sorry!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:28.710
I've contacted the authorities 
to request backup.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:30.540
Wood Street should be closed off soon.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.980
Chris, what's the situation there?

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.050
<i>I don't know how many 
of the four of them are players.</i>

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.300
<i>They're northbound on Lorain Street.</i>

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:39.550
Roger.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:41.710
I'll head them off and block them in.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.930
Hey, are you all right, Chris?!

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:49.490
I'm a little busy right now!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.650
Man, I wasn't prepared for that.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.940
Hey, Chris!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.880
Nice. We gave them the slip.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:04.620
Hey!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.200
Whoa!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.710
You can't get away.

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:15.290
Tch!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:18.430
Damn it!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:26.970
Play!

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.750
"Love and Peace"!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.860
One down.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.490
Two down.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.990
You bitch!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.270
Three down!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:49.950
Drop your weapon!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.120
We have a hostage!

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.810
H-H-Help me!

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.580
That's right. Drop it.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.130
Four down!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.630
That should be all of them.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.760
Not yet!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.230
Vijay!

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:24.240
Heh heh heh...

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.560
I'm John Doe.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.240
The player with "Agent S," the 4 of hearts.

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:33.010
Is this... a cloning power?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.750
No.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.390
I feel pain when hit.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.340
And I scar.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:43.470
This isn't cloning.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.360
Nor is it the art of the ninja.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:48.020
We are <i>all</i> John Doe!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.890
Take this!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.220
We're not done yet!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.150
There's no end to this!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:01.980
Are they infinite?!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:08.240
<i>No. If he could multiply infinitely, he'd
 overwhelm us with far greater numbers.</i>

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:12.010
<i>Most likely, he can divide 
himself into a maximum of five.</i>

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:13.920
Wendy...

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.410
Don't do anything uncalled for.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.450
I'll say it again!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.750
Drop your weapon!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.430
<i>Be calm, Wendy.</i>

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.130
This sharp-edged brilliance...

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.260
It's nothing short of diabolical.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.520
Discipline and improve yourself,

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.180
or else you'll inevitably be consumed 
and overpowered by the sword.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:47.290
You therefore mustn't rely on anyone,
 nor get close to anyone.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:52.530
All on your own, you must polish 
the true self buried within you.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.460
It is a path of solitude.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:15:02.740
Now, which path will you choose,
 my dear Wendy?

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.840
Dad, I...

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.840
This is the only path for me!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:13.350
I will walk the path of solitude, 
isolated from everyone!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.940
Wendy? You...

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:26.360
Wendy, you finally—

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.740
H-Hey!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:41.420
It's been so long, 
it's all the more irresistible!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.500
Wh-Wha...

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.570
What exactly are you?!

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:49.030
Oh?

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:53.050
I see one beardy face, two, three, four...

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.010
My, my, do we have quintuplets here?

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:06.040
D-Damn it!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.020
It's Vijay.

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:10.050
What's LAP?

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.400
LAP?!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:18.660
When Wendy draws her sword, the ace
 of spades, "Love and Peace," takes over.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.390
She'll attack anyone 
she can get her hands on.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.060
She's a ruthless killer!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.480
More! More!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.060
It's an all-you-can-eat buffet!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:30.330
Then how are we supposed to stop her?!

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.670
That's the question.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:39.070
My... Is that all, sweetheart?

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:44.300
That won't do! I haven't eaten my fill yet!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.350
But I guess I should toss out the scraps.

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:51.240
H-H-Help me...

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:55.590
He fainted? How lame.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.530
Hi, honey! Long time no see.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:02.950
I've been thinking about you, Veggie-jay.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.270
It's been a while, Love-P.

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.710
You're as lively as ever.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.210
Man up and show me what you're made of!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:12.090
Play!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.800
"Never No Dollars"!

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.220
You're all such troublesome subordinates!

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:24.230
That's the biggest safe in the country,
 used at Central Bank.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.730
Even with her power, it should be hard to—

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.500
Hey there, sweetie.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.230
It's been a while!

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:40.240
Are you all right?

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.660
She's like a walking tempest.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:49.300
You love to call me up when you're in 
trouble, yet you're so quick to ditch me.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.630
I'm not some doormat, you know?

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.880
Why don't we loosen our ties...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.220
so I can finish you in one go!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.890
What's up, Love-P?

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:01.430
Oh my.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.140
Ouch!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.280
Not even a warning?!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.650
Ah, Endless Meat!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.770
Oh my gosh, I <i>so</i> missed you!

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.930
I'm telling you, that hurts—

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.410
Gosh, this feels good!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:21.660
I can't resist!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.910
Give me something to sink my teeth into!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.540
As usual, your cards add up
 to nothing but air!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.790
That's right. You still don't know, Love-P.

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:32.930
What?

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:37.550
Let me introduce you... 
to the newest member of High Card!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.300
Do it now!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.090
Huh?

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:48.780
Like that's gonna work!

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:02.520
Without that, you go back to normal, right?

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:07.460
You have the face of a petty criminal who 
wouldn't hesitate to take a piss in public.

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:10.460
Still, you're not half bad.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:15.010
But I want to see a little more 
meat on you next time.

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:17.780
Your thighs look scrumptious.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:37.070
Your cooking doesn't seem to have improved.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.480
Because—

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.890
That's fine.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:43.550
You're warm, unlike me.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.870
You don't have to follow the same path.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.540
I want to be like you!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.370
And I will succeed you.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.720
Because, Dad, you're—

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:06.520
You do not have to walk the path of solitude.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:11.480
Someday, you may be blessed with 
friends who will walk beside you.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:16.010
That is my wish for you.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.660
Are you okay?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:30.040
I was dreaming.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.600
I have nightmares a lot too.

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:35.470
You should just call it a day.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.470
You brought me here?

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.750
With Chris.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.670
Welp, I'll be on my way.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.220
Everyone's right.

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.010
I shouldn't draw Love-P.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:52.570
There's no way I can walk 
the path of solitude alone.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.690
I'm not like my dad.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:59.690
If I'm going to cause trouble for
 everyone around me, I should just—

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:02.130
What's wrong with causing trouble?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.860
If something happens, I'll stop you again.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.200
We're a team, right?

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:10.670
A team?

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:16.860
My dad's wish...

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.510
Thank you.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:31.220
I feel like I'm forgetting something.

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.530
He's sure taking his time in the bathroom.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.730
Morning!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.630
Wow... Wow!

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:44.930
You're getting better 
at mopping the floor, Finn.

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:46.330
All thanks to my guidance—

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.610
Nuh-uh.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.110
Oh?

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.220
And she brought breakfast.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.370
As a thank-you for yesterday.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.370
Don't mind if I do.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.880
Thanks for the food!

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:04.460
Gross...

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.980
Next time: "POWER GAME."
